しまっている絵をお願いします。\n以前Skebに納品された、以下のようなイメージです。\nhttps://skeb.jp/@kurainao_/works/10\nhttps://skeb.jp/@kurainao_/works/11\n\nキャラ：\nhttps://imgur.com/ZYnLgri\n\n体位や服の有無はおまかせします。\n都合が合わないと感じたら遠慮なくキャンセルください。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kurainao_/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7f740a38/uploads/origins/9aba300d-b690-4ff8-ae0b-52b77278536a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dd4b79055408c605fd67af3ebacb706b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7f740a38/uploads/origins/9aba300d-b690-4ff8-ae0b-52b77278536a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dd4b79055408c605fd67af3ebacb706b, https://si.imgix.net/7f740a38/uploads/origins/9aba300d-b690-4ff8-ae0b-52b77278536a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ec925a496df180382f0debe85f377305 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7f740a38/uploads/origins/9aba300d-b690-4ff8-ae0b-52b77278536a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a20741b826b357f0e0c8340f719fcd5d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "このキャラクターがさらし台（ピロリ―）に拘束されたまま無表情で輪姦される姿を描いてください。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1I1u2mKcWjUSXMJzcGRccFNphAURSmlPj/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kurainao_/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/07c05310/uploads/origins/2bc8e494-16a8-46ff-807c-7e2fca975637?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a8bf85bbfcec12d991fd2566cfeb82c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/07c05310/uploads/origins/2bc8e494-16a8-46ff-807c-7e2fca975637?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a8bf85bbfcec12d991fd2566cfeb82c, https://si.imgix.net/07c05310/uploads/origins/2bc8e494-16a8-46ff-807c-7e2fca975637?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=486420511e7c60ae639115c32373dec2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/07c05310/uploads/origins/2bc8e494-16a8-46ff-807c-7e2fca975637?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cf1353954749bc1e248a7a4177e3d2d1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "初めまして、イラストを依頼します。\n\nキャラクター\n源内あお(フレームアームズ・ガール)\n\n服装\n学生制服\n\nシチュエーション\n・不良達に輪姦されている\n・他はおまかせ\n\nよろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kurainao_/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/84c8c2d2/uploads/origins/53901aa8-0cc7-41e9-899a-b53e3b7988e3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ab163d4ea329802fd19c07aa5568140e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/84c8c2d2/uploads/origins/53901aa8-0cc7-41e9-899a-b53e3b7988e3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ab163d4ea329802fd19c07aa5568140e, https://si.imgix.net/84c8c2d2/uploads/origins/53901aa8-0cc7-41e9-899a-b53e3b7988e3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1c9f248f95f97b4dcc6e7af858452689 2x, https://si.imgix.net/84c8c2d2/uploads/origins/53901aa8-0cc7-41e9-899a-b53e3b7988e3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=019ec6cb76f461b2b5f9bc6982f0b02b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kurainao_/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2773ccf9/uploads/origins/61fd4b61-350c-4e1f-be01-5dfcde38bc63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d839dde3f2065885a10a10d451631456", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2773ccf9/uploads/origins/61fd4b61-350c-4e1f-be01-5dfcde38bc63